      98.64,
      384.96,
      303.59,
      407.51
    ],
    "text": "My No. : DS/GFG/L&L/02/2009/02.Ministry of Land Reference No.: LD/05/2009/VT/98.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      422.64,
      303.52,
      482.63
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land AcquisitionAmendment Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude* which is requiredfor a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.04,
      497.52,
      289.96,
      507.59
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      514.8,
      303.56,
      599.99
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of 0.0524 Hectare markedas lot No. 01 in basic plan No. 4198 made by Surveyor Generalsituated in the village of Weliwatta in Grama Niladhari Divisionof 97A Weliwatta, within Municipal Council Limits ofGalle, in Divisional Secretary's Division of Four Gravets Galle,District of Galle, Southern Province. The description of theaforesaid land is as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      315.36,
      334.08,
      380.62,
      344.2
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      315.36,
      359.04,
      555.34,
      406.55
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Oroppuwatta Mawatha, Kebella,Assessment No. 09, Matara Road; Description: Home Garden,permanent building, and part of a dilapidated building;Claimant: Cannot find; Extent: 0.0524 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      315.36,
      421.44,
      555.98,
      544.07
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretariat, Four Gravets, Galle on the 25th dayof January 2017 at 09.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 18th day ofJanuary 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation and the datails ofthe said land/ servitude, the amount of compensation and thedetails of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
